  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/Logos/logo-fabric.png\" alt=\"Logo\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">| <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基百科</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge (Forge版)</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">发布版本(Forge)</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge (Fabric版)</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">发布版本(Fabric)</a> |</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">| <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/\" rel=\"nofollow\">源代码</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题反馈</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">提交请求</a> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon赞助</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fpartner%252fchisels-and-bits-glv\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreeperHost</a> |</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\"> </a></p><div>感谢游玩我们的模组！如果您想支持我们持续开发凿与位，请考虑在<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>上赞助我们。</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fpartner%252fchisels-and-bits-glv\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CreeperHost.png\" alt=\"CreepherHost\"> </a></p><div>感谢CreeperHost的慷慨支持，现在购买服务器可享25%折扣。点击上方图片，或在结账时使用优惠码\"chisels-and-bits\"！</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/ForFabric.png\" alt=\"For Forge\"></p><p>本模组专为Minecraft Fabric开发，需要<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Loader</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>才能正常运行。</p><div>如需在Forge版Minecraft使用凿与位模组，请下载专门适配Forge的版本：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>。</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Wiki.png\" alt=\"Wiki\"> </a></p><p>我们已尽力完善模组文档，您可以在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chiselsandbits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>查阅。如有遗漏请告知我们！</p><div>所有物品、方块及系统均有详细说明。</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\"> </a></p><p>除了维基文档外，我们还设有Discord服务器，您可以在此提问、讨论创意或获取帮助。</p><div>点击上方图片或<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>加入服务器。</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Contents.png\" alt=\"Mod contents\"></p><p>凿与位模组允许您分解世界中的方块，并自由重组这些碎片。</p><div>\n<div>想要更平滑的楼梯？没问题。</div>\n<div>想要更美观的屋顶或立柱？现在都能实现。</div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div>通过混合不同方块的碎片，您可以创造出全新外观和触感的方块。</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CompatibilityVanilla.png\" alt=\"Compatibility with Vanilla\"></p><p>默认支持所有实心完整方块（如原木、木板、矿石、存储方块等）。我们还特别适配了所有玻璃、树叶和草方块。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CompatibilityMods.png\" alt=\"Compatibility with Mods\"></p><p>模组方块也会自动检测兼容性。模组开发者可通过以下标签控制兼容性：</p><ul>\n<li><code>chiselsandbits:chiselable/forced</code> 强制允许凿刻（适用于玻璃类方块）</li>\n<li><code> chiselsandbits:chiselable/blocked</code> 禁止凿刻通常可凿的方块</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
